  "description": "📜 **Guild Operations** 📜\n\nIn order to ensure the repair and upkeep of the TP banner, a contribution of **50,000 golds** is  requested **7 days before its renewal deadline**, allowing for its maintenance and the extension of your stay within the guild.\n\nNo activity is required within the guild other than this contribution. The guild’s sole purpose is to provide cheaper teleportation access.\n\nAll payments must be sent to **Grimalkin**, who is responsible for collecting and allocating funds for the repair and maintenance of the guild building.",
